<title>POLAND: ComputerLand wins PLN 18.3 mln contract.</title>
<headline>ComputerLand wins PLN 18.3 mln contract.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish software company ComputerLand SA has signed an 18.3-million-zloty contract to provide telecom monopolist Telekomunikacja Polska SA (TPSA) a computer system, ComputerLand said in a statement on Thursday.</p>
<p>The company said that the system, including hardware and software to aid in investing, would be used in 18 TPSA local headquarters around the country.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
